From: redC0rvus <111829302+redC0rvus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 10:43:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 07/24] [general] system: flight recorder (--flight_recorder),
 dumped into crash bundles

Two lock-free rings stamped with time, guest frame and thread: sys (2000:
file opens, .afs read offsets, thread start/exit, XAM notifications) and
gpu (256: render target changes, resolves), so per-frame GPU churn can't
push out the sys events. Crash bundles get flight.txt.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
